#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:100
msgid "Installation of sawfish"
msgstr "Instalação do <quote>sawfish</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:111
msgid ""
"Install <application>sawfish</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>sawfish</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:115
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --with-pango  &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --with-pango   &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:119
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:123
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:129
msgid ""
"This package creates six <filename>.desktop</filename> files in the "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/share/xsessions/</filename> directory.  "
"All but one are needed in a BLFS system, so prevent the extra files showing "
"up as options in a display manager.  As the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote cria seis arquivos <filename>.desktop</filename> no diretório "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/share/xsessions/</filename>. Todos, "
"exceto um, são necessários em um sistema BLFS, de forma que evite os "
"arquivos extras aparecendo como opções em um gerenciador de exibição. Como "
"o(a) usante &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>rm -v /usr/share/xsessions/sawfish-*.desktop</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>rm -v /usr/share/xsessions/sawfish-*.desktop</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:164
msgid "Configuring sawfish"
msgstr "Configurando o <quote>sawfish</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:167
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:170
msgid "~/.xinitrc"
msgstr "~/.xinitrc"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:174
msgid ""
"Be sure to backup your current <filename>.xinitrc</filename> before "
"proceeding."
msgstr ""
"Certifique-se de produzir uma cópia de segurança do teu "
"&quot;<filename>.xinitrc</filename>&quot; atual antes de continuar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:178
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>exec sawfish</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>exec sawfish</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:183
msgid ""
"Optionally, you can use a Display Manager, such as <xref linkend=\"sddm\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Opcionalmente, você pode usar um Gerenciador de Tela, como o <xref "
"linkend=\"sddm\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/wm/sawfish.xml:188
msgid ""
"From the developers: <quote>The default menu binding is somewhat obscure; "
"you must middle-click on the background to bring up the menus.  (If you have"
" a two-button mouse, try clicking both buttons simultaneously)</quote>. You "
"can find this at <ulink "
"url=\"https://download.tuxfamily.org/sawfish/themes/FAQ.html/\">sawfish's "
"FAQ</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Oriundo dos(as) desenvolvedores(as): <quote>A ligação padrão do menu é um "
"tanto obscura; você precisa clicar com o botão do meio no plano de fundo "
"para abrir os menus. (Se você tiver um mouse de dois botões, [então] tente "
"clicar nos dois botões simultaneamente)</quote>. Você pode encontrar isso no"
" &quot;<ulink "
"url=\"https://download.tuxfamily.org/sawfish/themes/FAQ.html/\">FAQ do "
"sawfish</ulink>&quot;."

